Start a recording without opening the app: long-press the Parley icon or add the Parley Record tile to Quick Settings. During a meeting you can scroll up to re-read; a Latest button takes you back. Rename or delete a folder by long-pressing it, or add one with +. Recordings keep playing when you leave the app, with controls in the notification. New personal dictionary: names and jargon you add help transcription and sync with your account. A glow on the sign-in screen.